Error [E0357]: Local `I` must be snake_case
  --> tests/ui/confusable_name.jet:3:5
    |
  3 |     I :: 2
    |     ^
 Why: Jet enforces PascalCase for type-like names, snake_case for value-like names, and ALL_CAPS (SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE) for module-global constants (D-SHAPE-CASE1)
 Fix: Rename it to `i`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0357
